uidance":[3,3,0,3.57,{"raise":3,"reaffirm":0,"cut":0}],"ai_disruption":[0,0,0,0.0]},"move":{"r1":-0.0418,"r5":0.0315,"r20":0.0094,"r1_spy":-0.0396,"r5_spy":0.0288,"r20_spy":0.0091,"r1_sector":-0.0533,"r5_sector":0.0265,"r20_sector":0.0554,"etf":"XLY"}}],"quotes":[{"c":"ULTA 2016 Q2","e":"ulta","d":"2016-08-25","l":"streaming","r":"analyst","s":"Oliver Chen","x":"And also as brands go direct-to-consumer, it would be great to get briefed there.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"ULTA 2016 Q2","e":"ulta","d":"2016-08-25","l":"cost_cuts","r":"analyst","s":"Brian Tunick","x":"…store targets, and I know you'll update us at the Analyst Day, but I guess, if there's more department store closings coming or you guys think your e-comm penetration can get to a certain level, how does that inform ultimately what you think the right size of the North America store base can be?","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"ULTA 2017 Q4","e":"ulta","d":"2018-03-15","l":"cost_cuts","r":"analyst","s":"Jason Gere","x":"Because you guys haven't really gone through -- I wouldn't call it restructuring, but this level of some of this detail.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"ULTA 2017 Q4","e":"ulta","d":"2018-03-15","l":"cost_cuts","r":"analyst","s":"Jason Gere","x":"…out there, whether department stores who've kind of gone through this type of, I guess, cost-cutting efforts in the past that they're kind of near the tail end of those programs, you're at the beginning, it puts you in a competitive advantage as we think about the next couple of years?","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"ULTA 2018 Q1","e":"ulta","d":"2018-05-31","l":"ai_spend","r":"analyst","s":"Mary Dillon","x":"Having said that, we absolutely understand that there's more to be done as it relates to AI capabilities that we're building and investing in and going to continue to, to make sure that we are as advanced as we can be in terms of being as relevant, personalized.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"ULTA 2018 Q2","e":"ulta","d":"2018-08-30","l":"streaming","r":"analyst","s":"Mary Dillon","x":"We also continue to invest in network radio and streaming audio with Spotify and Pandora.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"ULTA 2018 Q2","e":"ulta","d":"2018-08-30","l":"streaming","r":"analyst","s":"Mary Dillon","x":"Of course, then there's lots of brands that are starting up as entrepreneurial, direct-to-consumer.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"ULTA 2018 Q2","e":"ulta","d":"2018-08-30","l":"pricing_power","r":"analyst","s":"Stephanie Schiller Wissink","x":"And how should we think about that equalizing over the course of the next several months, kind of as you pass through Q3 and into back half and then onward into '19?","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"ULTA 2019 Q1","e":"ulta","d":"2019-05-30","l":"tariffs","r":"analyst","s":"Christopher Horvers","x":"And then the last one, of course, topic du jour tariffs, what are your comments there?","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"ULTA 2019 Q1","e":"ulta","d":"2019-05-30","l":"tariffs","r":"analyst","s":"Mary Dillon","x":"And I'll add lastly on that tariff question.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"ULTA 2019 Q2","e":"ulta","d":"2019-08-29","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Scott Settersten","x":"Yes, so maybe we'll start with the tariff question.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"ULTA 2019 Q2","e":"ulta","d":"2019-08-29","l":"tariffs","r":"analyst","s":"Rupesh Parikh","x":"So first on the tariff side, we've seen some more mass companies talk about taking price.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"ULTA 2019 Q2","e":"ulta","d":"2019-08-29","l":"pricing_power","r":"analyst","s":"Rupesh Parikh","x":"I was just curious just given some of the noise out there, I want to get your thoughts on what you thought the consumer acceptance of the price increases are.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"ULTA 2020 Q3","e":"ulta","d":"2020-12-03","l":"dtc","r":"analyst","s":"Simeon Siegel","x":"So just thinking about potentially shrinking department stores but growing online beauty, maybe DTC brands, big box, et cetera.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"ULTA 2021 Q3","e":"ulta","d":"2021-12-02","l":"dtc","r":"analyst","s":"David Kimbell","x":"But on DTC, it's -- that's not new, not new this year.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"ULTA 2021 Q3","e":"ulta","d":"2021-12-02","l":"dtc","r":"analyst","s":"David Kimbell","x":"That's been DTC.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"ULTA 2022 Q2","e":"ulta","d":"2022-08-25","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Scott Settersten","x":"And price increases as far as product is concerned throughout the channels.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"ULTA 2022 Q2","e":"ulta","d":"2022-08-25","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Scott Settersten","x":"So pricing, we said about 300 basis points of price increases reflected in our 2Q results.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"ULTA 2022 Q4","e":"ulta","d":"2023-03-09","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"David Kimbell","x":"We believe that, that will return to kind of more steady state level of price increases going forward or at least into 2023.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"ULTA 2022 Q4","e":"ulta","d":"2023-03-09","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Scott Settersten","x":"We expect gross margin, again, modest deleverage there as we lap benefits and the timing of retail price increases during 2022, and we plan for a more normalized promotional environment overall.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"ULTA 2023 Q3","e":"ulta","d":"2023-11-30","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"David Kimbell","x":"We continue to reiterate our outlook of 1,500 to 1,700 stores, and towards -- and we've said that we believe we'll be towards the high end of that range.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"ULTA 2024 Q1","e":"ulta","d":"2024-05-30","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Paula Oyibo","x":"Merchandise margin declined during the quarter primarily due to increased promotions, adverse impact from brand mix and the lapping of benefits from price increases last year.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"ULTA 2024 Q1","e":"ulta","d":"2024-05-30","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Paula Oyibo","x":"We saw merchandise margin decline in Q1 generally for these similar reasons, increase in promo, adverse impacts from brand mix, and then we had a bit of lapping price increases from 2023.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"ULTA 2024 Q2","e":"ulta","d":"2024-08-29","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Paula Oyibo","x":"Merchandise margin declined primarily due to increased promotional activity, adverse impact from brand mix and the continued lapping of benefits from price increases last year.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"ULTA 2024 Q4","e":"ulta","d":"2025-03-13","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Paula Oyibo","x":"What I would say, like, in light everyone, we are monitoring the ever-changing landscape as it relates to tariffs.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"ULTA 2024 Q4","e":"ulta","d":"2025-03-13","l":"tariffs","r":"analyst","s":"Michael Baker","x":"I guess I'll ask about tariffs.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"ULTA 2024 Q4","e":"ulta","d":"2025-03-13","l":"pricing_power","r":"analyst","s":"Michael Baker","x":"And then there were definitely some price increases as I recall in two thousand seventeen and eighteen, but the timing was a little skewed.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"ULTA 2024 Q4","e":"ulta","d":"2025-03-13","l":"pricing_power","r":"analyst","s":"Michael Baker","x":"I think you took price before you even saw the margin.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"ULTA 2024 Q4","e":"ulta","d":"2025-03-13","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Kecia Steelman","x":"I've made organizational changes to streamline decision-making, and align our teams around guest-centric goals and I've leaned in where we have immediate opportunities to improve our execution.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"ULTA 2024 Q4","e":"ulta","d":"2025-03-13","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Kecia Steelman","x":"To successfully achieve our long-term growth ambitions, reassert our leadership position, and deliver value to our stakeholders, we must optimize ways of working and streamline our cost structure.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"ULTA 2025 Q4","e":"ulta","d":"2026-03-12","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Kecia L. Steelman","x":"And new UB Media capabilities like the addition of connected TV and streaming audio products that drove engagement and incremental ad revenue.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/03/12/ulta-beauty-ulta-q4-2025-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"ULTA 2025 Q4","e":"ulta","d":"2026-03-12","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Kecia L. Steelman","x":"…to meet the needs of our evolving business, and ongoing cost optimization efforts, including investment in AI and automation, like testing new conversational AI capabilities for our guest services team, which streamline and increase resolution efficiency and quality, as well as the…","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/03/12/ulta-beauty-ulta-q4-2025-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"ULTA 2025 Q4","e":"ulta","d":"2026-03-12","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Kecia L. Steelman","x":"…automation, like testing new conversational AI capabilities for our guest services team, which streamline and increase resolution efficiency and quality, as well as the implementation of an AI-powered order management system to optimize fulfillment across our network, enabling our expansion of","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/03/12/ulta-beauty-ulta-q4-2025-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"ULTA 2025 Q4","e":"ulta","d":"2026-03-12","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Kecia L. Steelman","x":"Finally, turning to our third area of focus, aligning our foundation for the future by optimizing our way of working and streamlining our cost structure.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/03/12/ulta-beauty-ulta-q4-2025-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"ULTA 2026 Q1","e":"ulta","d":"2026-06-02","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Kecia Steelman","x":"We will continue to execute our plans to support long-term growth and efficiency through investments in supply chain automation, merchandising systems and AI-powered tools to enhance operational performance, guest experience and profitable growth.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/06/03/ulta-beauty-ulta-q1-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"ULTA 2026 Q1","e":"ulta","d":"2026-06-02","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Christopher DelOrefice","x":"For the year, we are maintain